{"id":"n49234-1-7","stage":3,"title":"소득 · 收获","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49234-1-7-1","ko":"물고기는 많이 잡혔나요?","zh":"鱼抓到很多吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물고기는","meaning":"鱼","explanation":"물고기：鱼；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"물고기","audio":"/audio/83844ff2a2ce50f87e1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56181","senseId":"1","lemma":"물고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물고기는","audio":"/audio/3430b82a563fbc808078.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"잡혔나요?","meaning":"被抓住","explanation":"잡히다：被抓住；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"잡히다","audio":"/audio/4e82277a09474ac2305e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70656","senseId":"5","lemma":"잡히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡혔나요","audio":"/audio/2461106ced9bd60ce833.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"83844ff2a2ce50f8","term":"물고기","zh":"鱼","audio":"/audio/83844ff2a2ce50f87e1d.mp3","entryId":"56181","definition":"一种脊椎动物，生活在水中，有鳃、鳍和鳞片。","pronunciation":["물꼬기"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"4e82277a09474ac2","term":"잡히다","zh":"被抓住","audio":"/audio/4e82277a09474ac2305e.mp3","entryId":"70656","definition":"事情或机会等被人获得。","pronunciation":["자피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/680dc458c144595ba8e9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49234-1-7-2","ko":"글쎄요. 출항을 했는데 소득이 별로 없네요.","zh":"不好说。虽然已经出海了，但收获不太理想。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄요.","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄요：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60633","sen