9c1bd9f2c645c","term":"출항","zh":"出航，启航，起飞","audio":"/audio/b569c1bd9f2c645c1947.mp3","entryId":"79068","definition":"船或飞机出发航行。","pronunciation":["출항"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"5e4a1492f7cca144","term":"소득","zh":"收获，所得","audio":"/audio/5e4a1492f7cca144ba3e.mp3","entryId":"49234","definition":"作为某事的结果所获得的利益。","pronunciation":["소ː득"]},{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"（不）怎么，（不）太","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"（不）怎么，（不）太","pronunciation":["별로"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某物不多。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e60ae81c7c6c5aa7dc57.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.829,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49234","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不好说。虽然已经出海了，但收获不太理想。","你最晚什么时候能提交报告？","鱼抓到很多吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不好说。虽然已经出海了，但收获不太理想。","鱼抓到很多吗？","你最晚什么时候能提交报告？"],"answer":0}]}
